From f27deda4a5b56fbde8b6380f54e3d4ab2d9471ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:15:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 48/54] Complete stamps a waiter times out on after a GPU hang
 reset

A command queue torn down after a recovery waited forever in finishEvent
for a stamp the reset had lost: the engine is idle, so eventTimeout never
restarts anything, and the teardown held a lock WindowServer needed on
display wake, ending in a userspace watchdog panic. After a recovery this
boot, complete a stamp still behind its last issued value that has not
moved across three timeouts on it (-wex-reset-restore).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md              |  2 +-
 README_ja.md           |  2 +-
 WhateverXe/kern_xe.cpp | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

